{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.poster.avif?t=1760137811\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.webm?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.mp4?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSE YOURSELF INTO THE WORLD OF THE FLAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much can you take, until you snap? The Flat is a first-person action game set within the dark and grotesque walls of Corpo Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of a gray worker, just another cog in the corporate machine. Try to understand the twisted logic that powers this dystopian nightmare and use it to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.poster.avif?t=1760137811\" width=598 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.webm?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.mp4?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you snap? Will you send the boss on a wild goose chase with a fake memo or perhaps 'accidentally' trigger a cascade of events that leads to an office massacre? Your choice, your mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.poster.avif?t=1760137811\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.webm?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.mp4?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into a vibrant and dynamic world, bustling with characters living out their daily schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in high-octane combat that's as dynamic as you are. Use your surroundings for strategic advantage and turn the tides in your favor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into a unique stealth mechanic\u2014your goal isn't to hide, but to pretend to work. How well can you blend in?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautifully horrifying brutalist world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.poster.avif?t=1760137811\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.webm?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.mp4?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2523150?t=1760137811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2523150?t=1760137811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/37c7ba1c7c373dd9960a177ffe7f74c3ed1af86a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760137811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/37c7ba1c7c373dd9960a177ffe7f74c3ed1af86a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760137811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game represents a grim dystopian world and touches on subjects that are for mature audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.poster.avif?t=1760137811\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.webm?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.mp4?t=1760137811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSE YOURSELF INTO THE WORLD OF THE FLAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much can you take, until you snap? The Flat is a first-person action game set within the dark and grotesque walls of Corpo Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p 